OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pay tribute to 'ray of
OL,4,Asunshine' daughter killed by bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a girl killed after being
OL,7,Fhit by a bus in Ayrshire have
OL,8,Fremembered their daughter as "a ray of
OL,9,Fsunshine" and said they are devastated
OL,10,Fby her death.
OL,12,FSophia Aitken died on Tuesday after
OL,13,Fbeing struck by a Stagecoach bus at
OL,14,FLauchlan Way in Kilwinning.
OL,16,FThe 12-year-old Kilwinning Academy
OL,17,Fpupil was pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
